[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m Let's break down the problem into manageable steps:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m 1. **Express \(z\) in terms of its real and imaginary parts:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m    Let \(z = 4e^{i\theta} = 4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)\), where \(\theta\) is a real number.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m 2. **Substitute \(z\) into the expression:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m    (75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = (75 + 117i)4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m    Simplify the expression:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m    = 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta + i(75\sin\theta + 117\cos\theta)) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m    = 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta + i(75\sin\theta + 117\cos\theta)) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4}(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m    = 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta + i(75\sin\theta + 117\cos\theta)) + \frac{96\cos\theta + 144i\sin\theta + 144i\cos\theta + 144\sin\theta}{4}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m    = 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta + i(75\sin\theta + 117\cos\theta)) + 24\cos\theta + 36i\sin\theta + 36i\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m    = (300\cos\theta - 468\sin\theta + 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta) + i(300\sin\theta + 468\cos\theta + 36\cos\theta - 24\sin\theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m    \]
