[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m    The real part of the expression is \(324\cos\theta - 432\sin\theta\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m 3. **Maximize the real part:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m    The maximum value of \(324\cos\theta - 432\sin\theta\) is the amplitude of the expression, which is \(\sqrt{324^2 + 432^2}\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m    \[
