[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m [response] To solve the problem, we need to maximize the real part of the expression \((75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z}\) where \(|z| = 4\). Let's represent \(z\) in its polar form as \(z = 4e^{i\theta} = 4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)\). Then we can substitute this into the expression and find the real part.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m First, let's express the given expression in terms of \(\theta\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m (75 + 117i)z = (75 + 117i) \cdot 4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) = 4(75\cos\theta + 75i\sin\theta + 117i\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta) = 4((75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta) + i(75\sin\theta + 117\cos\theta))
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4} \cdot \frac{\cos\theta - i\sin\theta}{\cos^2\theta + \sin^2\theta} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4} (\cos\theta - i\sin\theta) = 24(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta) + 36i(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta) = 24\cos\theta + 24i\sin\theta + 36i\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta = (24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta) + i(24\sin\theta + 36\cos\theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m Now, we combine these two results:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m (75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = 4((75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta) + i(75\sin\theta + 117\cos\theta)) + ((24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta) + i(24\sin\theta + 36\cos\theta))
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m = (4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta) + 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta) + i(4(75\sin\theta + 117\cos\theta) + 24\sin\theta + 36\cos\theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m = (300\cos\theta - 468\sin\theta + 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta) + i(300\sin\theta + 468\cos\theta + 24\sin\theta + 36\cos\theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=45910)[0m \[
